      "content": "Thanks for this. It's a good start, but honestly, it feels a bit light. For our training data, we really need these summaries to be much more exhaustive to distinguish them from the basic ones. \n\nThe current one is around 180 words, but usually, the top-performing summaries in our test set are hitting over 600 or 700 words because they dive into every single detail from the reviews. \n\nCan you try again? Go much deeper. I need you to expand on every single point mentioned in the reviews—go into detail about the specific user experiences. Just remember, I'm still watching out for fluff/repetition, but we definitely need that word count to go up significantly to get a high enough score for this batch.",
